rule plan_choice v1
description "A rule typed with an IME left on: full-width digits, as well as the symbols. fmt writes the digits of a number in ASCII"

enum region = north | south | east | west
enum plan = first_plan | second_plan | combined_plan

inputs
  region : region
  amount : money[USD]  range >=０USD <=１０００USD
  units　: number  range ≧１ ≦１００

outputs
  chosen : plan

derive total : money[USD] = amount ＋ １０USD  range >=１０USD <=１０１０USD

table choice
policy unique
| region      | total       | units  | → chosen : plan |
| north、south | ≦１００USD  | -      | first_plan      |
| north、south | ＞１００USD | -      | second_plan     |
| east、west  | -           | ≦１０  | second_plan     |
| east、west  | -           | ＞１０ | combined_plan   |

examples
| region | amount   | units | → chosen      |
| north  | ５０USD  | １    | first_plan    |
| east   | ５０USD  | ２０  | combined_plan |
| south  | ９００USD | １   | second_plan   |
